// ダンジョン入場時に呼ぶ：無人かつ再湧き予定日を過ぎていればテーマを抽選して住み着かせる（他の巣窟ダンジョンと共通ロジック）
function checkOutpostRespawn(){
 _lairCheckRespawnGeneric('outpost', initOutpostDungeon);
}

// 部屋を討伐済みにし、全部屋討伐済みなら一掃成立（半年後に再湧き）
function defeatOutpostRoom(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._outpostDungeon;
 lair.nodeState[nodeId].defeated = true;
 const allDefeated = Object.keys(OUTPOST_ROOM_AREAS).every(id=>lair.nodeState[id].defeated);
 if(allDefeated){
  lair.lastThemeId = lair.themeId;
  lair.clearedDay = GAME_TIME.totalDays;
  lair.nextRespawnDay = GAME_TIME.totalDays + 180;
  lair.themeId = null;
 }
}

// ワンダリングモンスター判定（16%）。テーマ不在（無人期間）なら常にnull。areaは呼び出し側が指定する
function rollOutpostWandering(area){
 const lair = PC._outpostDungeon;
 if(!lair || !lair.themeId) return null;
 if(Math.random() >= 0.16) return null;
 const theme = _lairScenarioAwareTheme(lair.themeId);
 const table = (_lairAreaTableGeneric(theme, area)||[]).filter(e=>typeof e.spawn === 'function');
 if(!table.length) return null;
 const entry = table[Math.floor(Math.random()*table.length)];
 return entry.spawn();
}

// ワンダリングモンスターとの戦闘を開始し、勝利後は指定ノードへ戻る
function startOutpostWanderCombat(monsters, returnNode){
 const isNPCType = monsters.length && monsters[0].st !== undefined;
 const common = {
  win:'__noop__', lose:'DEAD', canFlee:true,
  onWin: ()=>{
   document.getElementById('cbt-area').classList.add('hidden');
   document.getElementById('scroll-area').classList.remove('in-combat');
   document.getElementById('text-win').style.display = '';
   cbtState = null;
   go(returnNode);
  },
 };
 if(isNPCType) startCombatNPC({ enemies: monsters, autoTreasure:true, ...common });
 else startCombat({ enemies: monsters, ...common });
}

// ノードID → 通路移動時のワンダリング判定に使うエリア番号（1〜3）。未登録のノードは判定なし
// （通路1・柱廊1＝入口直後の安全な区画のため対象外）
const OUTPOST_ENC_AREA = {
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_2:1,
 OUTPOST_JUNCTION_1:1,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_4:2,
 OUTPOST_JUNCTION_2:2,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_5:2,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_3:2,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_6:3,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_7:3,
 OUTPOST_CORRIDOR_8:3,
};
// 16%の確率でエリアNのワンダリングモンスターと遭遇しつつ移動する（他の巣窟ダンジョンと同じ仕組み）
function outpostMove(dest){
 const area = OUTPOST_ENC_AREA[dest];
 if(area){
  const wander = rollOutpostWandering(area);
  if(wander && wander.length){
   const counts = {};
   wander.forEach(m=>{ counts[m.name] = (counts[m.name]||0)+1; });
   const desc = Object.entries(counts).map(([n,c])=> c>1 ? `${n}×${c}` : n).join('、');
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8"> ${desc}が現れた！</span>`;
   renderChoices([]);
   drawScene('combat');
   startOutpostWanderCombat(wander, dest);
   return;
  }
 }
 go(dest);
}

// 一方向からしか見えない隠し扉を通る（通路8⟷通路1、部屋C⟷通路3）。
// 見える側から一度通ることで、見えない側にも初めて存在が判明する（孤島の深淵B4の隠し扉と同じ仕組み）
function outpostUseHiddenDoor(flagName, dest){
 PC[flagName] = true;
 outpostMove(dest);
}

// 巣窟ダンジョン共通レジストリ：各ダンジョンの状態プロパティ・エリア表・討伐関数・救助者リスト保存先をまとめる
// （シナリオの宝物庫／施錠された木箱／捕虜イベントを全8ダンジョンで共通処理するために使用）
const LAIR_DUNGEON_REG = {
 lair:  { stateProp:'_lairDungeon',  roomAreas:LAIR_ROOM_AREAS,  defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLairRoom(id),  rescuedNamesProp:'_lairRescuedNames',  wanderFn:(area)=>rollLairWandering(area),  wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLairWanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair2: { stateProp:'_lair2Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR2_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair2Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair2RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair2Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair2WanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair3: { stateProp:'_lair3Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR3_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair3Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair3RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair3Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair3WanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair4: { stateProp:'_lair4Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR4_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair4Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair4RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair4Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair4WanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair5: { stateProp:'_lair5Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR5_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair5Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair5RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair5Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair5WanderCombat(m,r) },
 niflair: { stateProp:'_niflairDungeon', roomAreas:NIFLAIR_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatNiflairRoom(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_niflairRescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollNiflairWandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startNiflairWanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair6: { stateProp:'_lair6Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR6_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair6Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair6RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair6Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair6WanderCombat(m,r) },
 lair7: { stateProp:'_lair7Dungeon', roomAreas:LAIR7_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatLair7Room(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_lair7RescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollLair7Wandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startLair7WanderCombat(m,r) },
 outpost: { stateProp:'_outpostDungeon', roomAreas:OUTPOST_ROOM_AREAS, defeatFn:(id)=>defeatOutpostRoom(id), rescuedNamesProp:'_outpostRescuedNames', wanderFn:(area)=>rollOutpostWandering(area), wanderCombatFn:(m,r)=>startOutpostWanderCombat(m,r) },
};

// 汎用：宝物庫・施錠された木箱・革袋・捕虜（rescue）の各kindを、指定した巣窟ダンジョン（key）向けに処理する
function _lairOpenTreasureRoomGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const lootHtml = generateTreasure(30);
 updateHUD();
 def.defeatFn(nodeId);
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ece0">中を検めると——</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${lootHtml}</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

function _lairTryRescueGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 renderChoices([
  {label:' 助ける', fn:()=>_lairRescueHelpGeneric(key, nodeId)},
  {label:' 放っておく', fn:()=>_lairRescueIgnoreGeneric(key, nodeId)},
 ]);
}
function _lairRescueHelpGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 PC[def.rescuedNamesProp] = PC[def.rescuedNamesProp] || [];
 PC[def.rescuedNamesProp].push(ns.captiveName);
 def.defeatFn(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ece0">鎖を解き放つと、${ns.captiveName}は涙を浮かべて何度も礼を言った。</span><br><span style="color:#c8b8a0">町に戻ったら、無事に送り届けよう。</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}
function _lairRescueIgnoreGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 def.defeatFn(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">${ns.captiveName}を置き去りにして、その場を後にした。</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}
// 帰還時に呼ぶ：助け出した捕虜がいれば謝礼（1人につき100〜300GP）をまとめて支払う
function _lairPayRescueRewardGeneric(key){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const names = PC[def.rescuedNamesProp];
 if(!names || !names.length) return;
 let total = 0;
 names.forEach(()=>{ total += 100 + Math.floor(Math.random()*201); }); // 100〜300GP/人
 gainGP(total, PC);
 updateHUD();
 showSaveToast(`${names.join('、')}を解放した！謝礼として${total}GPを受け取った`);
 PC[def.rescuedNamesProp] = [];
}

function _lairTryVaultGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const vc = ns.cfg || {};
 const cfg = { level: vc.level || 3, area: vc.failArea || 3 };
 const casters = [PC, ...(PC.party||[])].filter(n=> n.con>0 && (n.spells||[]).some(s=>s.fn==='knockKnock'));
 if(casters.length){
  renderChoices([
   {label:' 器用さで解錠を試みる', fn:()=>_lairVaultBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg)},
   ...casters.map(c=>({label:` ${c===PC?PC.name:c.name}がUnlockの魔法を唱える`, fn:()=>_lairVaultUnlockLevelSelectGeneric(key, c, nodeId, cfg)})),
  ]);
 } else {
  _lairVaultBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg);
 }
}
function _lairVaultBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:cfg.level,
  onSuccess(){ _lairVaultOpenGeneric(key, nodeId); },
  onFail(){ _lairLockboxFailGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">鍵は開かなかった。</span>`); },
 });
}
function _lairVaultUnlockLevelSelectGeneric(key, caster, nodeId, cfg){
 const modal = document.getElementById('spell-modal');
 const ctxEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-ctx');
 const listEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-list');
 ctxEl.textContent = '宝箱を開けるための強さでUnlockを唱える' + (caster!==PC?`（${caster.name}）`:'');
 listEl.innerHTML = '';
 const maxLv = caster.type === 'rogue' ? 1 : (caster.level||1);
 for(let lv=1; lv<=maxLv; lv++){
  const cost = 2*lv;
  const dcost = _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost);
  const canAfford = caster.st > dcost;
  const btn = document.createElement('button');
  btn.className = 'sm-spell-btn';
  btn.disabled = !canAfford;
  btn.innerHTML = `
   <span class="sm-name">Lv${lv}</span>
   <span class="sm-cost">ST -${dcost}${dcost!==cost?`（杖で${cost}→${dcost}）`:''}　（現在ST ${caster.st}）</span>`;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
   closeSpellModal();
   _lairVaultCastUnlockGeneric(key, caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg);
  });
  listEl.appendChild(btn);
 }
 modal.classList.add('open');
}
function _lairVaultCastUnlockGeneric(key, caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg){
 caster.st = Math.max(0, caster.st - _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost));
 gainAPAll(cost);
 updateHUD();
 const casterLabel = caster!==PC ? `${caster.name}の詠唱。` : '';
 if(lv >= cfg.level){
  const s = document.getElementById('story');
  if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">Unlockが効いた。鍵が開いた！${casterLabel}</span>`;
  _lairVaultOpenGeneric(key, nodeId);
 } else {
  _lairLockboxFailGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">呪文の力が及ばず、鍵は開かなかった。${casterLabel}</span>`);
 }
}
// 解錠成功：宝物庫の中身を獲得する。金額・宝石数はns.cfg（テーブルエントリ）指定を優先し、未指定なら100〜600GP＋宝石3個
function _lairVaultOpenGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 const vc = ns.cfg || {};
 const gpMin = vc.gpMin != null ? vc.gpMin : 100;
 const gpMax = vc.gpMax != null ? vc.gpMax : 600;
 const gemCount = vc.gemCount != null ? vc.gemCount : 3;
 const gp = gpMin + Math.floor(Math.random()*(gpMax-gpMin+1));
 gainGP(gp, PC);
 const gems = [];
 for(let i=0;i<gemCount;i++) gems.push(generateJewel());
 updateHUD();
 def.defeatFn(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">宝箱を開けると——</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${gp}GP と 宝石${gemCount}個（${gems.join('、')}）</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

function _lairTryLockboxGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const cfg = { level:2, area:2 };
 const casters = [PC, ...(PC.party||[])].filter(n=> n.con>0 && (n.spells||[]).some(s=>s.fn==='knockKnock'));
 if(casters.length){
  renderChoices([
   {label:' 器用さで解錠を試みる', fn:()=>_lairLockboxBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg)},
   ...casters.map(c=>({label:` ${c===PC?PC.name:c.name}がUnlockの魔法を唱える`, fn:()=>_lairLockboxUnlockLevelSelectGeneric(key, c, nodeId, cfg)})),
  ]);
 } else {
  _lairLockboxBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg);
 }
}
function _lairLockboxBySRGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:cfg.level,
  onSuccess(){ _lairLockboxOpenGeneric(key, nodeId); },
  onFail(){ _lairLockboxFailGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">鍵は開かなかった。</span>`); },
 });
}
function _lairLockboxUnlockLevelSelectGeneric(key, caster, nodeId, cfg){
 const modal = document.getElementById('spell-modal');
 const ctxEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-ctx');
 const listEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-list');
 ctxEl.textContent = '木箱を開けるための強さでUnlockを唱える' + (caster!==PC?`（${caster.name}）`:'');
 listEl.innerHTML = '';
 const maxLv = caster.type === 'rogue' ? 1 : (caster.level||1);
 for(let lv=1; lv<=maxLv; lv++){
  const cost = 2*lv;
  const dcost = _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost);
  const canAfford = caster.st > dcost;
  const btn = document.createElement('button');
  btn.className = 'sm-spell-btn';
  btn.disabled = !canAfford;
  btn.innerHTML = `
   <span class="sm-name">Lv${lv}</span>
   <span class="sm-cost">ST -${dcost}${dcost!==cost?`（杖で${cost}→${dcost}）`:''}　（現在ST ${caster.st}）</span>`;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
   closeSpellModal();
   _lairLockboxCastUnlockGeneric(key, caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg);
  });
  listEl.appendChild(btn);
 }
 modal.classList.add('open');
}
function _lairLockboxCastUnlockGeneric(key, caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg){
 caster.st = Math.max(0, caster.st - _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost));
 gainAPAll(cost);
 updateHUD();
 const casterLabel = caster!==PC ? `${caster.name}の詠唱。` : '';
 if(lv >= cfg.level){
  const s = document.getElementById('story');
  if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">Unlockが効いた。鍵が開いた！${casterLabel}</span>`;
  _lairLockboxOpenGeneric(key, nodeId);
 } else {
  _lairLockboxFailGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">呪文の力が及ばず、鍵は開かなかった。${casterLabel}</span>`);
 }
}
function _lairLockboxOpenGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const loot1 = generateTreasure(50);
 const loot2 = generateTreasure(50);
 updateHUD();
 def.defeatFn(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">鍵が開いた。</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${loot1}</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${loot2}</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}
// 解錠失敗時：16%でcfg.areaのワンダリングモンスターと遭遇（失敗しても中身は残り、後で再挑戦できる）。木箱・宝物庫の宝箱で共用。
function _lairLockboxFailGeneric(key, nodeId, cfg, msgHtml){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const wander = def.wanderFn(cfg.area);
 if(wander && wander.length){
  if(s) s.innerHTML += msgHtml + `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">物音を聞きつけたのか、何かが近づいてくる気配がする……</span>`;
  renderChoices([{label:' ワンダリングモンスターと戦う', fn:()=>def.wanderCombatFn(wander, nodeId)}]);
 } else {
  if(s) s.innerHTML += msgHtml;
  renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
 }
}

// 汎用：指定ダンジョン（key）の部屋状態表示テキスト。シナリオ（kind別）に対応
function _lairRoomStatusTextGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 if(!lair.themeId) return '';
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return `<br><br><span style="color:#b0a080">争いの痕跡が残るのみで、今は静まり返っている。</span>`;
 if(!ns.monsters){
  const theme = _lairScenarioAwareTheme(lair.themeId);
  const area = def.roomAreas[nodeId];
  const table = _lairAreaTableGeneric(theme, area);
  if(!table || !table.length){
   ns.monsters = [];
   ns.kind = 'monster';
   ns.defeated = true;
   return '';
  }
  const entry = table[Math.floor(Math.random()*table.length)];
  ns.kind = entry.kind || 'monster';
  ns.cfg = entry;
  ns.monsters = (ns.kind === 'monster') ? entry.spawn() : [];
  if(ns.kind === 'rescue' && !ns.captiveName){
   ns.captiveName = NPC_NAMES[Math.floor(Math.random()*NPC_NAMES.length)];
   ns.captiveLabel = Math.random()<0.5 ? '町人' : '村人';
  }
 }
 arcDBossHook(key, nodeId, ns);
 if(ns.kind === 'treasure') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">床に古びた革袋が落ちている。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'lockbox') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">施錠された木箱が置かれている。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'vault') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">部屋の奥に、装飾が施された大きな宝箱が置かれている。鍵がかかっているようだ。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'rescue') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">鎖に繋がれた${ns.captiveLabel}の${ns.captiveName}が、助けを求めるようにこちらを見ている。</span>`;
 const counts = {};
 ns.monsters.forEach(m=>{ counts[m.name] = (counts[m.name]||0)+1; });
 const desc = Object.entries(counts).map(([n,c])=> c>1 ? `${n}×${c}` : n).join('、');
 return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${desc}が姿を現した！</span>`;
}

// 汎用：指定ダンジョン（key）の部屋の戦闘／イベントを開始する（kind別にディスパッチ）
function _lairStartEncounterGeneric(key, nodeId){
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.kind === 'treasure'){ _lairOpenTreasureRoomGeneric(key, nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'lockbox'){ _lairTryLockboxGeneric(key, nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'vault'){ _lairTryVaultGeneric(key, nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'rescue'){ _lairTryRescueGeneric(key, nodeId); return; }
 const monsters = ns.monsters;
 if(!monsters || !monsters.length) return;
 const isNPCType = monsters[0].st !== undefined;
 const common = {
  win: nodeId, lose:'DEAD', canFlee:true, fleeTo: _lastNodeId,
  onWin: ()=>{ def.defeatFn(nodeId); },
 };
 if(isNPCType) startCombatNPC({ enemies: monsters, autoTreasure:true, ...common });
 else startCombat({ enemies: monsters, ...common });
}

// 汎用：指定ダンジョン（key）の再湧き判定。通常テーマ90%／シナリオ10%で抽選し、シナリオ名も割り当てる
function _lairCheckRespawnGeneric(key, initFn){
 initFn();
 const def = LAIR_DUNGEON_REG[key];
 const lair = PC[def.stateProp];
 if(!lair.themeId && GAME_TIME.totalDays >= lair.nextRespawnDay){
  const scenarioIds = Object.keys(LAIR5_SCENARIOS);
  let pick;
  if(scenarioIds.length && Math.random() < 0.10){
   const pool = lair.lastThemeId ? scenarioIds.filter(t=>t!==lair.lastThemeId) : scenarioIds;
   const src = pool.length ? pool : scenarioIds;
   pick = src[Math.floor(Math.random()*src.length)];
  } else {
   const ids = Object.keys(LAIR_THEMES);
   const candidates = lair.lastThemeId ? ids.filter(t=>t!==lair.lastThemeId) : ids;
   pick = candidates[Math.floor(Math.random()*candidates.length)];
  }
  lair.themeId = pick;
  lair.spawnDay = GAME_TIME.totalDays;
  lair.clearedDay = null;
  if(LAIR5_SCENARIOS[pick]){
   const sd = LAIR5_SCENARIOS[pick];
   const cnt = sd.nameCount != null ? sd.nameCount : 1;
   const names = [];
   while(names.length < cnt){
    const cand = NPC_NAMES[Math.floor(Math.random()*NPC_NAMES.length)];
    if(!names.includes(cand)) names.push(cand);
   }
   lair.scenarioNames = names.length ? names : null;
   lair.scenarioSorcererName = names[0] || null;
  } else {
   lair.scenarioNames = null;
   lair.scenarioSorcererName = null;
  }
  Object.keys(def.roomAreas).forEach(id=>{ lair.nodeState[id] = { defeated:false, monsters:null }; });
 }
}

// 部屋ノードの状態表示用テキストを返す（未生成なら初回訪問時にエンカウントをキャッシュ生成する）
function lair5RoomStatusText(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 if(!lair.themeId) return '';
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return `<br><br><span style="color:#b0a080">争いの痕跡が残るのみで、今は静まり返っている。</span>`;
 if(!ns.monsters){
  const theme = _lair5GetTheme(lair.themeId);
  const area = LAIR5_ROOM_AREAS[nodeId];
  const table = _lair5AreaTable(theme, area);
  if(!table || !table.length){
   // このエリアには何も配置されていない（シナリオがエリア4・5を定義していない場合など）
   ns.monsters = [];
   ns.kind = 'monster';
   ns.defeated = true;
   return '';
  }
  const entry = table[Math.floor(Math.random()*table.length)];
  ns.kind = entry.kind || 'monster';
  ns.cfg = entry; // vault等、kind別の個別パラメータ（level/failArea/gpMin等）を後で参照できるようキャッシュする
  ns.monsters = (ns.kind === 'monster') ? entry.spawn() : [];
  if(ns.kind === 'rescue' && !ns.captiveName){
   ns.captiveName = NPC_NAMES[Math.floor(Math.random()*NPC_NAMES.length)];
   ns.captiveLabel = Math.random()<0.5 ? '町人' : '村人';
  }
 }
 arcDBossHook('lair5', nodeId, ns);
 if(ns.kind === 'treasure') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">床に古びた革袋が落ちている。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'lockbox') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">施錠された木箱が置かれている。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'vault') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">部屋の奥に、装飾が施された大きな宝箱が置かれている。鍵がかかっているようだ。</span>`;
 if(ns.kind === 'rescue') return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">鎖に繋がれた${ns.captiveLabel}の${ns.captiveName}が、助けを求めるようにこちらを見ている。</span>`;
 const counts = {};
 ns.monsters.forEach(m=>{ counts[m.name] = (counts[m.name]||0)+1; });
 const desc = Object.entries(counts).map(([n,c])=> c>1 ? `${n}×${c}` : n).join('、');
 return `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${desc}が姿を現した！</span>`;
}

// 部屋の選択肢ラベルを種別に応じて返す（宝物庫は「宝箱を開ける」、革袋・施錠された木箱は「調べる」、捕虜は「近づく」、モンスターは「戦う」）
function _lair5EncounterLabel(ns){
 if(ns.kind === 'vault') return ' 宝箱を開ける';
 if(ns.kind === 'rescue') return ' 近づく';
 if(ns.kind === 'treasure' || ns.kind === 'lockbox') return ' 調べる';
 return ' 戦う';
}

// 部屋の戦闘を開始する（NPC型／MR型を自動判別してディスパッチ。宝物系・捕虜の部屋は専用処理へ振り分ける）
function startLair5Encounter(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.kind === 'treasure'){ _lair5OpenTreasureRoom(nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'lockbox'){ _lair5TryLockbox(nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'vault'){ _lair5TryVault(nodeId); return; }
 if(ns.kind === 'rescue'){ _lair5TryRescue(nodeId); return; }
 const monsters = ns.monsters;
 if(!monsters || !monsters.length) return;
 const isNPCType = monsters[0].st !== undefined;
 const common = {
  win: nodeId, lose:'DEAD', canFlee:true, fleeTo: _lastNodeId,
  onWin: ()=>{ defeatLair5Room(nodeId); },
 };
 if(isNPCType) startCombatNPC({ enemies: monsters, autoTreasure:true, ...common });
 else startCombat({ enemies: monsters, ...common });
}

// 部屋を討伐済みにし、全部屋討伐済みなら一掃成立（半年後に再湧き）
function defeatLair5Room(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 lair.nodeState[nodeId].defeated = true;
 const allDefeated = Object.keys(LAIR5_ROOM_AREAS).every(id=>lair.nodeState[id].defeated);
 if(allDefeated){
  lair.lastThemeId = lair.themeId;
  lair.clearedDay = GAME_TIME.totalDays;
  lair.nextRespawnDay = GAME_TIME.totalDays + 180;
  lair.themeId = null;
 }
}

// エリア1の革袋を検める（即時解決、戦闘なし）
function _lair5OpenTreasureRoom(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const lootHtml = generateTreasure(30);
 updateHUD();
 defeatLair5Room(nodeId);
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ece0">中を検めると——</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${lootHtml}</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

// エリア3の捕虜（誘拐された町人／村人）：助けるか放っておくかを選ぶ（戦闘なし）。
// 助けた場合は名前を記録しておき、マラカイに帰還した時点でまとめて謝礼（1人100〜300GP）を支払う
function _lair5TryRescue(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 renderChoices([
  {label:' 助ける', fn:()=>_lair5RescueHelp(nodeId)},
  {label:' 放っておく', fn:()=>_lair5RescueIgnore(nodeId)},
 ]);
}

function _lair5RescueHelp(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 PC._lair5RescuedNames = PC._lair5RescuedNames || [];
 PC._lair5RescuedNames.push(ns.captiveName);
 defeatLair5Room(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#f0ece0">鎖を解き放つと、${ns.captiveName}は涙を浮かべて何度も礼を言った。</span><br><span style="color:#c8b8a0">町に戻ったら、無事に送り届けよう。</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

function _lair5RescueIgnore(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 defeatLair5Room(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">${ns.captiveName}を置き去りにして、その場を後にした。</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

// マラカイ帰還時に呼ぶ：助け出した捕虜がいれば謝礼（1人につき100〜300GP）をまとめて支払う
function _lair5PayRescueReward(){
 const names = PC._lair5RescuedNames;
 if(!names || !names.length) return;
 let total = 0;
 names.forEach(()=>{ total += 100 + Math.floor(Math.random()*201); }); // 100〜300GP/人
 gainGP(total, PC);
 updateHUD();
 showSaveToast(`${names.join('、')}を解放した！謝礼として${total}GPを受け取った`);
 PC._lair5RescuedNames = [];
}

// エリア3の宝物庫（大きな宝箱）：施錠されている。器用さLv能力値テスト、またはLv以上のUnlockの魔法で解錠する
// level／失敗時の遭遇エリア／中身の金額・宝石数は、抽選されたテーブルエントリ（ns.cfg）ごとに指定できる（未指定時はLv3・エリア3・100〜600GP・宝石3個）
function _lair5TryVault(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const vc = ns.cfg || {};
 const cfg = { level: vc.level || 3, area: vc.failArea || 3 };
 const casters = [PC, ...(PC.party||[])].filter(n=> n.con>0 && (n.spells||[]).some(s=>s.fn==='knockKnock'));
 if(casters.length){
  renderChoices([
   {label:' 器用さで解錠を試みる', fn:()=>_lair5VaultBySR(nodeId, cfg)},
   ...casters.map(c=>({label:` ${c===PC?PC.name:c.name}がUnlockの魔法を唱える`, fn:()=>_lair5VaultUnlockLevelSelect(c, nodeId, cfg)})),
  ]);
 } else {
  _lair5VaultBySR(nodeId, cfg);
 }
}

function _lair5VaultBySR(nodeId, cfg){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:cfg.level,
  onSuccess(){ _lair5VaultOpen(nodeId); },
  onFail(){ _lair5LockboxFail(nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">鍵は開かなかった。</span>`); },
 });
}

function _lair5VaultUnlockLevelSelect(caster, nodeId, cfg){
 const modal = document.getElementById('spell-modal');
 const ctxEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-ctx');
 const listEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-list');
 ctxEl.textContent = '宝箱を開けるための強さでUnlockを唱える' + (caster!==PC?`（${caster.name}）`:'');
 listEl.innerHTML = '';
 const maxLv = caster.type === 'rogue' ? 1 : (caster.level||1);
 for(let lv=1; lv<=maxLv; lv++){
  const cost = 2*lv;
  const dcost = _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost);
  const canAfford = caster.st > dcost;
  const btn = document.createElement('button');
  btn.className = 'sm-spell-btn';
  btn.disabled = !canAfford;
  btn.innerHTML = `
   <span class="sm-name">Lv${lv}</span>
   <span class="sm-cost">ST -${dcost}${dcost!==cost?`（杖で${cost}→${dcost}）`:''}　（現在ST ${caster.st}）</span>`;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
   closeSpellModal();
   _lair5VaultCastUnlock(caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg);
  });
  listEl.appendChild(btn);
 }
 modal.classList.add('open');
}

function _lair5VaultCastUnlock(caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg){
 caster.st = Math.max(0, caster.st - _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost));
 gainAPAll(cost);
 updateHUD();
 const casterLabel = caster!==PC ? `${caster.name}の詠唱。` : '';
 if(lv >= cfg.level){
  const s = document.getElementById('story');
  if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">Unlockが効いた。鍵が開いた！${casterLabel}</span>`;
  _lair5VaultOpen(nodeId);
 } else {
  _lair5LockboxFail(nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">呪文の力が及ばず、鍵は開かなかった。${casterLabel}</span>`);
 }
}

// 解錠成功：宝物庫の中身を獲得する。金額・宝石数はns.cfg（テーブルエントリ）指定を優先し、未指定なら100〜600GP＋宝石3個
function _lair5VaultOpen(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 const vc = ns.cfg || {};
 const gpMin = vc.gpMin != null ? vc.gpMin : 100;
 const gpMax = vc.gpMax != null ? vc.gpMax : 600;
 const gemCount = vc.gemCount != null ? vc.gemCount : 3;
 const gp = gpMin + Math.floor(Math.random()*(gpMax-gpMin+1));
 gainGP(gp, PC);
 const gems = [];
 for(let i=0;i<gemCount;i++) gems.push(generateJewel());
 updateHUD();
 defeatLair5Room(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">宝箱を開けると——</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${gp}GP と 宝石${gemCount}個（${gems.join('、')}）</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

// エリア2の施錠された木箱：器用さLv2能力値テスト、またはLv2以上のUnlockの魔法で解錠する
function _lair5TryLockbox(nodeId){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 const ns = lair.nodeState[nodeId];
 if(ns.defeated) return;
 const cfg = { level:2, area:2 };
 const casters = [PC, ...(PC.party||[])].filter(n=> n.con>0 && (n.spells||[]).some(s=>s.fn==='knockKnock'));
 if(casters.length){
  renderChoices([
   {label:' 器用さで解錠を試みる', fn:()=>_lair5LockboxBySR(nodeId, cfg)},
   ...casters.map(c=>({label:` ${c===PC?PC.name:c.name}がUnlockの魔法を唱える`, fn:()=>_lair5LockboxUnlockLevelSelect(c, nodeId, cfg)})),
  ]);
 } else {
  _lair5LockboxBySR(nodeId, cfg);
 }
}

function _lair5LockboxBySR(nodeId, cfg){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:cfg.level,
  onSuccess(){ _lair5LockboxOpen(nodeId); },
  onFail(){ _lair5LockboxFail(nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">鍵は開かなかった。</span>`); },
 });
}

function _lair5LockboxUnlockLevelSelect(caster, nodeId, cfg){
 const modal = document.getElementById('spell-modal');
 const ctxEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-ctx');
 const listEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-list');
 ctxEl.textContent = '木箱を開けるための強さでUnlockを唱える' + (caster!==PC?`（${caster.name}）`:'');
 listEl.innerHTML = '';
 const maxLv = caster.type === 'rogue' ? 1 : (caster.level||1);
 for(let lv=1; lv<=maxLv; lv++){
  const cost = 2*lv;
  const dcost = _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost);
  const canAfford = caster.st > dcost;
  const btn = document.createElement('button');
  btn.className = 'sm-spell-btn';
  btn.disabled = !canAfford;
  btn.innerHTML = `
   <span class="sm-name">Lv${lv}</span>
   <span class="sm-cost">ST -${dcost}${dcost!==cost?`（杖で${cost}→${dcost}）`:''}　（現在ST ${caster.st}）</span>`;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
   closeSpellModal();
   _lair5LockboxCastUnlock(caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg);
  });
  listEl.appendChild(btn);
 }
 modal.classList.add('open');
}

function _lair5LockboxCastUnlock(caster, lv, cost, nodeId, cfg){
 caster.st = Math.max(0, caster.st - _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost));
 gainAPAll(cost);
 updateHUD();
 const casterLabel = caster!==PC ? `${caster.name}の詠唱。` : '';
 if(lv >= cfg.level){
  const s = document.getElementById('story');
  if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">Unlockが効いた。鍵が開いた！${casterLabel}</span>`;
  _lair5LockboxOpen(nodeId);
 } else {
  _lair5LockboxFail(nodeId, cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">呪文の力が及ばず、鍵は開かなかった。${casterLabel}</span>`);
 }
}

function _lair5LockboxOpen(nodeId){
 const loot1 = generateTreasure(50);
 const loot2 = generateTreasure(50);
 updateHUD();
 defeatLair5Room(nodeId);
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">鍵が開いた。</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${loot1}</span><br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">${loot2}</span>`;
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
}

// 解錠失敗時：16%でcfg.areaのワンダリングモンスターと遭遇（失敗しても中身は残り、後で再挑戦できる）。木箱・宝物庫の宝箱で共用。
function _lair5LockboxFail(nodeId, cfg, msgHtml){
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const wander = rollLair5Wandering(cfg.area);
 if(wander && wander.length){
  if(s) s.innerHTML += msgHtml + `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">物音を聞きつけたのか、何かが近づいてくる気配がする……</span>`;
  renderChoices([{label:' ワンダリングモンスターと戦う', fn:()=>startLair5WanderCombat(wander, nodeId)}]);
 } else {
  if(s) s.innerHTML += msgHtml;
  renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(nodeId)}]);
 }
}

// エリアの脅威テーブルから強制的にモンスターを1組抽選する（テーマ不在／モンスター系の候補が無いなら常にnull）
function lair5SpawnAreaMonster(area){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 if(!lair || !lair.themeId) return null;
 const theme = _lair5GetTheme(lair.themeId);
 const table = (_lair5AreaTable(theme, area)||[]).filter(e=>typeof e.spawn === 'function');
 if(!table.length) return null;
 const entry = table[Math.floor(Math.random()*table.length)];
 return entry.spawn();
}

// ワンダリングモンスター判定（16%）。テーマ不在（無人期間）なら常にnull
function rollLair5Wandering(area){
 const lair = PC._lair5Dungeon;
 if(!lair || !lair.themeId) return null;
 if(Math.random() >= 0.16) return null;
 return lair5SpawnAreaMonster(area);
}

// ワンダリングモンスターとの戦闘を開始し、勝利後は指定ノードへ戻る
function startLair5WanderCombat(monsters, returnNode){
 const isNPCType = monsters.length && monsters[0].st !== undefined;
 const common = {
  win:'__noop__', lose:'DEAD', canFlee:true,
  onWin: ()=>{
   document.getElementById('cbt-area').classList.add('hidden');
   document.getElementById('scroll-area').classList.remove('in-combat');
   document.getElementById('text-win').style.display = '';
   cbtState = null;
   go(returnNode);
  },
 };
 if(isNPCType) startCombatNPC({ enemies: monsters, autoTreasure:true, ...common });
 else startCombat({ enemies: monsters, ...common });
}

// 施錠されたドアの処理。器用さでcfg.level能力値テストに成功するか、cfg.level以上のUnlockの魔法が必要。
// 失敗時は16%で指定エリアのワンダリングモンスターと戦闘になる
// cfg: { level, dest, from, area, key? }（keyは両側から個別に施錠されている扉（部屋1⇔3、部屋2⇔5）の共有フラグに使う）
function lair5TryDoor(cfg){
 const doorKey = cfg.key || cfg.dest;
 if(PC['_lair5DoorOpen_'+doorKey]){ go(cfg.dest); return; }
 const casters = [PC, ...(PC.party||[])].filter(n=> n.con>0 && (n.spells||[]).some(s=>s.fn==='knockKnock'));
 if(casters.length){
  renderChoices([
   {label:' 器用さで解錠を試みる', fn:()=>lair5UnlockBySR(cfg)},
   ...casters.map(c=>({label:` ${c===PC?PC.name:c.name}がUnlockの魔法を唱える`, fn:()=>lair5OpenUnlockLevelSelect(c, cfg)})),
  ]);
 } else {
  lair5UnlockBySR(cfg);
 }
}

function lair5UnlockBySR(cfg){
 const doorKey = cfg.key || cfg.dest;
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:cfg.level,
  onSuccess(){
   PC['_lair5DoorOpen_'+doorKey] = true;
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">鍵が開いた。</span>`;
   renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(cfg.dest)}]);
  },
  onFail(){
   lair5DoorFailOutcome(cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">鍵は開かなかった。</span>`);
  },
 });
}

function lair5OpenUnlockLevelSelect(caster, cfg){
 const modal = document.getElementById('spell-modal');
 const ctxEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-ctx');
 const listEl = document.getElementById('spell-modal-list');
 ctxEl.textContent = '扉を開けるための強さでUnlockを唱える' + (caster!==PC?`（${caster.name}）`:'');
 listEl.innerHTML = '';
 const maxLv = caster.type === 'rogue' ? 1 : (caster.level||1);
 for(let lv=1; lv<=maxLv; lv++){
  const cost = 2*lv;
  const dcost = _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost);
  const canAfford = caster.st > dcost;
  const btn = document.createElement('button');
  btn.className = 'sm-spell-btn';
  btn.disabled = !canAfford;
  btn.innerHTML = `
   <span class="sm-name">Lv${lv}</span>
   <span class="sm-cost">ST -${dcost}${dcost!==cost?`（杖で${cost}→${dcost}）`:''}　（現在ST ${caster.st}）</span>`;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
   closeSpellModal();
   lair5CastUnlockAtLevel(caster, lv, cost, cfg);
  });
  listEl.appendChild(btn);
 }
 modal.classList.add('open');
}

function lair5CastUnlockAtLevel(caster, lv, cost, cfg){
 caster.st = Math.max(0, caster.st - _applyStaffDiscount(caster, cost));
 gainAPAll(cost);
 updateHUD();
 const casterLabel = caster!==PC ? `${caster.name}の詠唱。` : '';
 const doorKey = cfg.key || cfg.dest;
 if(lv >= cfg.level){
  PC['_lair5DoorOpen_'+doorKey] = true;
  const story = document.getElementById('story');
  story.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">Unlockが効いた。鍵が開いた！${casterLabel}</span>`;
  renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(cfg.dest)}]);
 } else {
  lair5DoorFailOutcome(cfg, `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">呪文の力が及ばず、鍵は開かなかった。${casterLabel}</span>`);
 }
}

// 解錠失敗時の共通処理：16%で指定エリアのワンダリングモンスターと戦闘になる
function lair5DoorFailOutcome(cfg, msgHtml){
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const wander = rollLair5Wandering(cfg.area);
 if(wander && wander.length){
  s.innerHTML += msgHtml + `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">物音を聞きつけたのか、何かが近づいてくる気配がする……</span>`;
  renderChoices([{label:' ワンダリングモンスターと戦う', fn:()=>startLair5WanderCombat(wander, cfg.from)}]);
 } else {
  s.innerHTML += msgHtml;
  renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(cfg.from)}]);
 }
}

// 調べ物系ギミック共通：運でLv1能力値テストを行い、失敗すると該当エリアのモンスターが必ず出現する
// cfg: { area, returnNode, successMsg, failMsg }
function lair5ExamineDanger(cfg){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'lk', level:1,
  onSuccess(){
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#c8b8a0">${cfg.successMsg}</span>`;
   renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(cfg.returnNode)}]);
  },
  onFail(){
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">${cfg.failMsg}</span>`;
   const monsters = lair5SpawnAreaMonster(cfg.area);
   if(monsters && monsters.length){
    if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">物音に気づかれた！モンスターが現れた！</span>`;
    renderChoices([{label:' 迎え撃つ', fn:()=>startLair5WanderCombat(monsters, cfg.returnNode)}]);
   } else {
    renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(cfg.returnNode)}]);
   }
  },
 });
}

// 部屋1：緑色の粘液を調べる。器用さでLv1能力値テストに失敗すると酸で1-6ダメージ（成功しても何も分からない）
function lair5ExamineOoze(returnNode){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:1,
  onSuccess(){
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#c8b8a0">皮膚に触れないよう慎重に調べてみたが、正体は分からなかった。</span>`;
   renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(returnNode)}]);
  },
  onFail(){
   const dmg = d6();
   PC.con = Math.max(0, PC.con - dmg);
   updateHUD();
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#e0d0d0">酸性の粘液が皮膚に直接触れてしまった！　体力-${dmg}</span>`;
   if(PC.con<=0){ renderChoices([{label:'…（力尽きた）', go:'DEAD'}]); return; }
   renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(returnNode)}]);
  },
 });
}

// 部屋8：祭壇を調べる。器用さでLv1能力値テストに成功すると隠し金庫（標準の宝物生成表）を発見する。
// 成功・失敗にかかわらず16%でエリア1のワンダリングモンスターが出現する
function lair5ExamineAltar(returnNode){
 setupSavingRoll({
  attr:'dex', level:1,
  onSuccess(){
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   let result = '';
   let attempts = 0;
   do { result = generateTreasure(60); attempts++; }
   while(attempts < 5 && (result.includes('CP（') || result.includes('SP（')));
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ece0">祭壇の側面に注意深く隠された小さな金庫を見つけた！　${result}</span>`;
   updateHUD();
   lair5AltarAfterCheck(returnNode);
  },
  onFail(){
   const s = document.getElementById('story');
   if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#c8b8a0">祭壇を調べてみたが、何も見つからなかった。</span>`;
   lair5AltarAfterCheck(returnNode);
  },
 });
}
function lair5AltarAfterCheck(returnNode){
 const s = document.getElementById('story');
 const wander = rollLair5Wandering(1);
 if(wander && wander.length){
  if(s) s.innerHTML += `<br><span style="color:#f0ddd8">物音に気づかれた！モンスターが現れた！</span>`;
  renderChoices([{label:' 迎え撃つ', fn:()=>startLair5WanderCombat(wander, returnNode)}]);
  return;
 }
 renderChoices([{label:'▶ OK', fn:()=>go(returnNode)}]);
}

