// 結婚観のヒント（信頼度90以上限定）：「こういう生活がしたい」という理想の漏らし方
function _marriagePrefLifestyleHint(npc){
 const pref = npc.marriagePref;
 switch(pref){
  case 'wealth': return '……たまに思うんだ。何不自由なく、たっぷり金を持って暮らせたらどんなに楽か、ってな。';
  case 'strength': return '……いつか、心から頼れる強い人のそばで、安心して暮らしてみたいものだ。';
  case 'alignment': return '……自分と同じような考え方をする相手と、余計な気を遣わずに暮らせたらいいと思う。';
  case 'intelligence': return '……物知りな相手と、静かに語り合いながら暮らす。そんな毎日に憧れるよ。';
  case 'charm': return '……華やかで魅力的な人のそばにいられたら、それだけで幸せかもしれないな。';
  case 'age': return '……歳の近い相手と、対等な立場で寄り添って生きていけたらいいと思う。';
  case 'trust': return '……この土地でしっかり信頼を積み上げた相手と、地に足のついた暮らしがしたい。';
  case 'danger': return '……少し危険な匂いのする相手と歩む人生も、悪くないと思ってしまうんだ。';
  case 'profession': {
   const jaMap = {warrior:'戦士のような頼れる相手', wizard:'魔法使いのような知恵者', rogue:'盗賊のような機転の利く相手'};
   const ja = jaMap[npc.marriagePrefProfession] || '頼れる相手';
   return `……${ja}と支え合って暮らせたら、と時々考える。`;
  }
  case 'race': {
   const raceJaMap = {human:'人間',elf:'エルフ',dwarf:'ドワーフ',halfling:'ハーフリング',fairy:'フェアリー',leprechaun:'レプラコーン',troll:'トロール',ogre:'オーガ',orc:'オーク',goblin:'ゴブリン'};
   const ja = raceJaMap[npc.marriagePrefRace] || npc.marriagePrefRace;
   return `……${ja}の相手と、暮らしを共にしたいと思うことがある。`;
  }
  default: return null;
 }
}

// NPCがPCに求婚してくる条件：信頼度MAX・未婚同士・結婚観との相性が高水準
function _npcWantsToPropose(npc){
 if((npc.trust??0) < 100) return false;
 if(npc.married) return false;
 if((PC.spouse||[]).length > 0) return false;
 if(!npc.marriagePref) return false;
 const bonus = calcMarriagePrefBonus(npc, PC.town);
 return bonus >= 15;
}

function _npcProposeLine(npc){
 const lines = [
  `……ずっと考えていたんだ。${PC.name}、一緒になってくれないか。`,
  `こんなことを言うのは柄じゃないが……${PC.name}、添い遂げてくれないか。`,
  `もう迷わない。${PC.name}、夫婦になってくれ。`,
  `長く一緒にいて、確信した。${PC.name}、結婚してほしい。`,
 ];
 return lines[Math.floor(Math.random()*lines.length)];
}

function npcProposeAccept(idx){
 const npc = PC.party[idx];
 if(!npc) return;
 const chatId = `npc-chat-${idx}`;
 const log = document.getElementById(`${chatId}-log`);
 npc.married = true;
 if(!PC.spouse) PC.spouse = [];
 PC.spouse.push({name:npc.name, townId:PC.town, marriedDay:GAME_TIME.totalDays});
 addLifeEvent('', `${npc.name}と結婚した。`);
 updateHUD();
 if(log){
  log.innerHTML += `<div style="color:#e8d8b0;margin-bottom:8px"> ${npc.name}と結ばれた。</div>`;
  log.scrollTop = 9999;
 }
}

function npcProposeDecline(idx){
 const npc = PC.party[idx];
 if(!npc) return;
 const chatId = `npc-chat-${idx}`;
 const log = document.getElementById(`${chatId}-log`);
 if(log){
  log.innerHTML += `<div style="color:#c8b8a0;margin-bottom:8px">${npc.name}: ……そうか。分かった、気にしないでくれ。</div>`;
  log.scrollTop = 9999;
 }
}

// ボタン一発で信頼度・季節・地方に応じた話題を1つ返す（自由入力の代替）
function npcChat(npc){
 function pick(arr){ return arr[Math.floor(Math.random()*arr.length)]; }
 function byType(obj){ return obj[npc.type] || obj.warrior; }

 const trust = npc.trust ?? 0;
 const date = getCurrentDate();
 const season = _seasonFromMonth(date.month);
 const regionKey = getRegionKey(PC.town);

 const pools = [];
 // どんな信頼度でも聞ける話題
 pools.push(()=>pick(NPC_TALK_WEATHER[season]));
 pools.push(()=>pick(NPC_TALK_SEASON[season]));
 if(regionKey && NPC_TALK_REGION[regionKey]) pools.push(()=>pick(NPC_TALK_REGION[regionKey]));

 // 信頼度30以上：雑談
 if(trust >= 30){
  pools.push(()=>pick(byType(NPC_TALK.greet)));
  const conPct = npc.con / npc.maxCon;
  pools.push(()=>pick(conPct>0.6 ? NPC_TALK.status._healthy : conPct>0.3 ? NPC_TALK.status._wounded : NPC_TALK.status._critical));
  pools.push(()=>pick(NPC_TALK.party));
  pools.push(()=>pick(byType(NPC_TALK.money)));
  pools.push(()=>pick(byType(NPC_TALK.combat)));
 }
 // 信頼度70以上：背景知識
 if(trust >= 70){
  const bg = npc.background?.family || '';
  for(const [key, lines] of Object.entries(NPC_TALK.origin)){
   if(bg.includes(key)){ const line = pick(lines); pools.push(()=>line); break; }
  }
  const mot = npc.background?.motive;
  if(mot) pools.push(()=>mot);
 }
 // 信頼度90以上：結婚観のヒント
 if(trust >= 90){
  if(!npc.marriagePref) Object.assign(npc, _rollMarriagePref());
  const hint = _marriagePrefLifestyleHint(npc);
  if(hint) pools.push(()=>hint);
 }
 // 信頼度MAX＋結婚観との相性が高水準：低確率でNPCから求婚してくる
 if(_npcWantsToPropose(npc) && Math.random() < 0.05){
  pools.push(()=>({propose:true}));
 }

 return pick(pools)();
}

// ── NPC会話（スタンドアロン・台詞テーブル方式） ──

function talkToNPC(idx){
 const npc = PC.party[idx];
 if(!npc) return;
 const el = document.getElementById('sp-party-content');
 const chatId = `npc-chat-${idx}`;
 if(!document.getElementById(chatId)){
 const div = document.createElement('div');
 div.id = chatId;
 div.style.cssText = 'margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--void);padding-top:10px';
 div.innerHTML = `
 <div style="font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 2px);color:#e8e0d8;margin-bottom:6px"> ${npc.name}との会話</div>
 <div id="${chatId}-log" style="background:#050510;border:1px solid var(--shadow);border-radius:3px;padding:8px;min-height:60px;max-height:200px;overflow-y:auto;font-size:var(--font-sm);color:var(--text);line-height:2;margin-bottom:6px"></div>
 <button onclick="npcChatButton(${idx})"
 style="width:100%;font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 2px);padding:8px 10px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--bark);color:#f0ece0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px"> 話しかける</button>`;
 el.appendChild(div);
 }
}

function npcChatButton(idx){
 const npc = PC.party[idx];
 if(!npc) return;
 const chatId = `npc-chat-${idx}`;
 const log = document.getElementById(`${chatId}-log`);
 if(!log) return;

 const reply = npcChat(npc);
 if(reply && typeof reply === 'object' && reply.propose){
  const line = _npcProposeLine(npc);
  log.innerHTML += `<div style="color:#f0ece0;margin-bottom:6px">${npc.name}: ${line}</div>
   <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
    <button onclick="npcProposeAccept(${idx})" style="flex:1;background:var(--info-bg);border:1px solid #484848;color:#e0d8c8;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 2px);padding:7px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:3px">受け入れる</button>
    <button onclick="npcProposeDecline(${idx})" style="flex:1;background:#150808;border:1px solid #5a3030;color:#c89090;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 2px);padding:7px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:3px">断る</button>
   </div>`;
  log.scrollTop = 9999;
  return;
 }
 log.innerHTML += `<div style="color:#f0ece0;margin-bottom:8px">${npc.name}: ${reply}</div>`;
 log.scrollTop = 9999;
}

// 募集ノード生成
function makeRecruitNodes(){
 const defs = [
 {key:'RECRUIT_KHAZAN', town:'khazan', back:'TAVERN_KHAZAN', label:'カザーヌの大酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_PORT', town:'port_argon',back:'TAVERN_PORT', label:'波止場の酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_STONE', town:'stonehiem', back:'TAVERN_STONE', label:'鉱夫の飲み屋'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_ELSIA', town:'elsia', back:'TAVERN_ELSIA', label:'賢者の隠れ家'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_VERDA', town:'verda', back:'TAVERN_VERDA', label:'ヴェルダの酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_RIMHOLM',town:'rimholm', back:'TAVERN_RIMHOLM', label:'リムホルムの宿場酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_MARAKAI', town:'marakai', back:'TAVERN_MARAKAI', label:'マラカイの傭兵亭'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_AL_RASHID',town:'al_rashid', back:'TAVERN_AL_RASHID', label:'アル・ラシードの隊商宿'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_OASIS', town:'oasis_fort', back:'TAVERN_OASIS', label:'オアシス砦の酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_SAROON', town:'saroon', back:'TAVERN_SAROON', label:'サルーンの掘り小屋'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_DUNA', town:'duna', back:'TAVERN_DUNA', label:'デュナの天幕酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_YELDUN', town:'yeldun', back:'TAVERN_YELDUN', label:'イェルドゥンの岩場酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_FROSTPEAK', town:'frostpeak', back:'TAVERN_FROSTPEAK', label:'霜峰の宿屋酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_ASHVEIL', town:'ashveil', back:'TAVERN_ASHVEIL', label:'灰の村の鍛冶場酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_VALDHEIM', town:'valdheim', back:'TAVERN_VALDHEIM', label:'氷壁の砦酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_NIFURVIK', town:'nifurvik', back:'TAVERN_NIFURVIK', label:'凍海の船乗り酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_ISKALD',   town:'iskald',  back:'TAVERN_ISKALD',   label:'坑夫の溜まり場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_NERIA',    town:'neria',   back:'TAVERN_NERIA',    label:'砦の酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_DORUA',    town:'dorua',   back:'TAVERN_DORUA',    label:'ドルアの酒場'},
 {key:'RECRUIT_KALVO',    town:'kalvo',   back:'TAVERN_KALVO',    label:'砦の酒場'},
 ];
 const nodes = {};
 defs.forEach(({key,town,back,label})=>{
 nodes[key] = {
 scene: (['verda','rimholm','marakai'].includes(town)?'town_village':town==='al_rashid'?'town_desert_city':['oasis_fort','saroon','duna'].includes(town)?'town_desert_village':town==='khazan'?'town_khazan':town==='port_argon'?'town_port':town==='elsia'?'town_elsia':town==='yeldun'?'town_mountain_city':['frostpeak','ashveil','nifurvik','iskald'].includes(town)?'town_mountain_village':town==='valdheim'?'town_stone':['neria','kalvo'].includes(town)?'town_stone':['dorua','sarpe','nebra'].includes(town)?'town_village':'town_stone'),
 txt:()=>{
 const npcs = getTavernNPCs(town);
 nodes[key]._npcs = npcs;
 const party = PC.party||[];
 if(!PC._recruitedSlots) PC._recruitedSlots = {};
 let html = ` <span style="color:#f0ece0">${label} — 仲間を探す</span><br><br>`;
 html += renderPartyStatus();
 if(party.length>=3){
  html += `<span style="color:#c0b098">パーティは3人まで。誰かを外してから誘おう。</span>`;
  return html;
 }
 html += `<span style="color:#c0b098">今日の酒場には3人の冒険者がいる。それぞれ一度だけ声をかけられる。</span><br><br>`;
 npcs.forEach((n,i)=>{
  const already = party.find(p=>p._npcId===n._npcId);
  const invited = PC._recruitedSlots[n._tavernSlot];
  const badge = already
   ? `<span style="color:#f0ece0;font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 3px)"> パーティ中</span>`
   : invited
   ? `<span style="color:#d0c8b8;font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 3px)"> 声をかけた</span>`
   : '';
  html += `<div style="background:var(--panel);border:1px solid ${already?'var(--nature-border)':invited?'#a0a0a0':'var(--void)'};border-radius:3px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:6px">
  <span style="color:${already?'var(--nature2)':invited?'var(--dim2)':'var(--gold3)'};font-size:var(--font-sm)"> ${n.name}</span>${badge}
  <span style="font-size:calc(var(--font-sm) - 2px);color:#e8e0d0;margin-left:6px">${npcRecruitDesc(n)}</span>
  </div>`;
 });
 return html;
 },
 choices:()=>{
 if(!PC._recruitedSlots) PC._recruitedSlots = {};
 const npcs = nodes[key]._npcs || getTavernNPCs(town);
 const party = PC.party||[];
 const choices = [];
 if(party.length<3){
  npcs.forEach((n,i)=>{
   const already = party.find(p=>p._npcId===n._npcId);
   const invited = PC._recruitedSlots[n._tavernSlot];
   if(!already && !invited){
    const nLv = n.level||1;
    choices.push({
     label:` ${n.epithet?n.epithet+' ':''}${n.name}を誘う（魅力 Lv${nLv} 能力値テスト）`,
     fn:()=>{
      PC._recruitedSlots[n._tavernSlot] = true;
      startRecruitSR(n, key, nLv);
     },
    });
   }
  });
 }
 // 現在のパーティメンバーを解散
 (PC.party||[]).forEach((n,i)=>{
  choices.push({
   label:` ${n.name}を解散させる`,
   fn:()=>{ addLifeEvent('', `${n.name}がパーティを離れた。`); addFormerCompanion(n); PC.party.splice(i,1); showSaveToast(`${n.name}が去った。`); },
   go: key,
  });
 });
 choices.push({label:'← 酒場に戻る', go: back});
 return choices;
 },
 };
 });
 return nodes;
}

// ── 暗殺者遭遇 ──────────────────────────────────────
function startAssassinEncounter(ts){
 travelState = ts;
 const assassinLevel = Math.max(3, Math.min(10, (PC.level||1) + 1));
 const leader = generateNPC(assassinLevel);
 leader.bountyTitle = '暗殺者';
 const minionCount = 1 + Math.floor(Math.random()*2); // 1〜2人
 const minions = Array(minionCount).fill(0).map(()=>{
  const m = generateNPC(Math.max(1, assassinLevel-2));
  return {...m, curCon:m.con};
 });

 // travel-log-wrapがなければ作成
 const storyEl = document.getElementById('story');
 if(storyEl && !document.getElementById('travel-log-wrap')){
  storyEl.innerHTML += `<div id="travel-log-wrap" style="border-top:1px solid var(--panel2);margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;font-size:var(--font-base)"><div id="travel-events"></div></div>`;
 }
 travelLog(`<div style="padding:8px;background:#1a0808;border:1px solid var(--rust);border-radius:4px;font-size:var(--font-sm)"><span style="color:#c8b8a0">${ts.daysDone}日目：前方から武装した人物が現れた。目つきが鋭い——旅人ではない。</span></div>`);

 const choices = document.getElementById('choices');
 choices.innerHTML = '';
 const btn = document.createElement('button');
 btn.className = 'choice-btn';
 btn.textContent = ' 迎え撃つ';
 btn.onclick = ()=>{
  choices.innerHTML = '';
  drawScene('combat');
  document.getElementById('dice-area').classList.add('hidden');
  hideMagicArea();
  startCombatNPC({
   enemies:[{...leader, curCon:leader.con}, ...minions],
   canFlee: true,
   win:'__noop__',
   lose:'DEAD',
   onWin:()=>{
    addLifeEvent('','旅の途中で暗殺者に襲われたが、撃退した。');
    const gp = assassinLevel * 20;
    gainGPAll(gp);
    updateHUD();
    // ログを退避（text-win表示でstoryがリセットされる前に）
    const savedLog = document.getElementById('travel-log-wrap');
    const savedLogHTML = savedLog ? savedLog.outerHTML : '';
    document.getElementById('text-win').style.display = '';
    drawScene('travel');
    const s = document.getElementById('story');
    s.innerHTML = savedLogHTML || `<div id="travel-log-wrap" style="border-top:1px solid var(--panel2);margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;font-size:var(--font-base)"><div id="travel-events"></div></div>`;
    travelLog(`<span style="color:#f0ece0"> ${ts.daysDone}日目：暗殺者を撃退した。懐に${gp}GPの路銀があった。</span>`);
    renderChoices([{label:'▶ 旅を続ける', fn:()=>{
     renderChoices([]);
     ts._resumeWithoutIncrement = true;
     setTimeout(_travelTickSched(), ts.interval);
    }}]);
   },
  });
 };
 choices.appendChild(btn);
}

