    + `&nbsp;&nbsp;依頼人=${a.client.title}${a.client.name}（${arcTown(a.clientTown)}）　聞き込み=${arcTown(a.askTown)}　終点=${arcTown(a.endTown)}　身内=${a.culprit.rel}${a.culprit.name}(${a.reason}/${a.kinFate})　故買商=${a.fence.name}<br><br>`;
